{
    "background_story": "Jolie was a thrill-seeking entrepreneur who made a name for herself in the world of action sports. Growing up near the beach, she developed a passion for surfing and skateboarding, eventually turning her hobbies into a career. Jolie co-founded a company that designed and manufactured high-performance surfboards and skateboards. Her innovative approach to board design and her commitment to sustainability quickly gained her a loyal following among athletes and environmentalists alike. Jolie's company became a leading brand in the industry, and she was soon invited to sit on the boards of several prominent action sports organizations. Her leadership and expertise helped shape the future of the sports she loved, inspiring a new generation of athletes and entrepreneurs to follow in her footsteps.",
